flowchart TD
    A([Login request]) --> B{Username and<br/>password entered?}
    B -- No --> X1[ValidationException] --> Z([Show error])
    B -- Yes --> C[Find user by username or email]
    C --> D{User exists?}
    D -- No --> X2[AuthenticationException<br/>'Invalid username or password'] --> Z
    D -- Yes --> E{Account active?}
    E -- No --> X3[Account locked / disabled] --> Z
    E -- Yes --> F[PBKDF2 hash entered password<br/>with stored salt, 65536 iterations]
    F --> G{Hash matches?<br/>constant-time compare}
    G -- No --> H[failed_attempts + 1<br/>audit LOGIN_FAILED]
    H --> I{attempts >= 5?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Lock account] --> Z
    I -- No --> X2
    G -- Yes --> K[Reset failed attempts, update last_login<br/>audit LOGIN]
    K --> M{Role}
    M -- CUSTOMER --> N[Web customer dashboard]
    M -- ADMIN / OPERATOR --> O[Desktop console / admin dashboard]
